# Frontend build environment template.
#
# Do not put third-party AI provider API keys in this file.
# Vite exposes VITE_* variables in the public browser bundle, so provider keys
# must be configured server-side through:
#   前台管理员账号菜单 → 管理后台 → API 厂商配置
#
# Local and production generation calls go through backend routes such as
# /api/gemini/text, /api/gemini/image, /api/gpt-image/generate, and /api/video/*.
#
# No frontend environment variables are required for the current 创剧 build.
